1270
02:05:17,511 --> 02:05:18,762
Jarvis!

1271
02:05:18,845 --> 02:05:20,597
<i>Selamat pulang, tuan.</i>

1272
02:05:24,017 --> 02:05:29,523
“Aku Iron Man”. Kau pikir hanya kau
pahlawan super di dunia?

1273
02:05:29,856 --> 02:05:33,110
Tn. Stark, kau jadi bagian jagat
yg lebih besar.

1274
02:05:33,193 --> 02:05:34,986
Hanya belum tahu.

1275
02:05:35,487 --> 02:05:37,280
Kau siapa?

1276
02:05:37,489 --> 02:05:40,200
Nick Fury, Direktur SHIELD.

1277
02:05:42,285 --> 02:05:45,288
Aku mau bicara soal Avenger Initiative.